{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/c38122afb65b9fb9b13098ed1115b6fc.avif?t=1758984729\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The gates have opened. The rules are simple: escape\u2026 or stay forever.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/83743c3c357f879d1cedb0fc26a272b5.poster.avif?t=1758984729\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/83743c3c357f879d1cedb0fc26a272b5.webm?t=1758984729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/83743c3c357f879d1cedb0fc26a272b5.mp4?t=1758984729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u25c8   \u25c8</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/995c66b278b340a78dfe4dbc4960d864.avif?t=1758984729\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Exploring a haunted manor quickly turns into a twisted game of survival. Split apart by walls but connected by voice, you\u2019ll have to rely on each other if you want to see the outside again.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/cfea3c04bdbdeebf637f90ec1633a736.poster.avif?t=1758984729\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/cfea3c04bdbdeebf637f90ec1633a736.webm?t=1758984729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/cfea3c04bdbdeebf637f90ec1633a736.mp4?t=1758984729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u25c8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u25c8</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/4d91bfb9f71c80ee596017f408fa3fc0.avif?t=1758984729\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You\u2019ll never see the full picture alone. Half the clues are yours, the rest belong to your partner \u2014 share what you see and guide each other through the unknown\u2026 and be careful what else might be listening. Built-in 3D voice chat keeps you connected.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/17670618c883a0e9281459d7ad718ec3.poster.avif?t=1758984729\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/17670618c883a0e9281459d7ad718ec3.webm?t=1758984729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/17670618c883a0e9281459d7ad718ec3.mp4?t=1758984729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PLEASE NOTE:</strong> This escape can only be played in co-op. Each player needs their own device and game copy.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u25c8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u25c8</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/a8b999a0328a019a7e558f41f028998f.avif?t=1758984729\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And it\u2019s not your partner keeping you company.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/4fee23895da6df96f68520a8c4a1a249.poster.avif?t=1758984729\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/4fee23895da6df96f68520a8c4a1a249.webm?t=1758984729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/4fee23895da6df96f68520a8c4a1a249.mp4?t=1758984729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u25c8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u25c8</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/d826bb2d1324ee4e6d77db3dd1a2d89d.avif?t=1758984729\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Private lobbies for friends, public lobbies for strangers \u2014 either way, you\u2019ll be inside the manor in moments. Getting out? That\u2019s the hard part.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >